{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Caches\/documentation\/Caches\/LRUCache"},"abstract":[{"text":"A bounded dictionary that evicts its least recently used entry to make room: lookup,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"insertion, removal and eviction each take O(1) on average.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Caches\/documentation\/Caches\/LRUCache\/Entry"],"anchor":"Structures","generated":true,"title":"Structures"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Caches\/documentation\/Caches\/LRUCache\/init(capacity:)","doc:\/\/Caches\/documentation\/Caches\/LRUCache\/init(checkedCapacity:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Caches\/documentation\/Caches\/LRUCache\/capacity","doc:\/\/Caches\/documentation\/Caches\/LRUCache\/count","doc:\/\/Caches\/documentation\/Caches\/LRUCache\/isEmpty"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Caches\/documentation\/Caches\/LRUCache\/contains(_:)","doc:\/\/Caches\/documentation\/Caches\/LRUCache\/insert(_:forKey:)","doc:\/\/Caches\/documentation\/Caches\/LRUCache\/peek(_:)","doc:\/\/Caches\/documentation\/Caches\/LRUCache\/removeAll()","doc:\/\/Caches\/documentation\/Caches\/LRUCache\/removeLeastRecentlyUsed()","doc:\/\/Caches\/documentation\/Caches\/LRUCache\/removeValue(forKey:)","doc:\/\/Caches\/documentation\/Caches\/LRUCache\/updateValue(_:forKey:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Caches\/documentation\/Caches\/LRUCache\/subscript(_:)"],"anchor":"Subscripts","generated":true,"title":"Subscripts"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Caches\/documentation\/Caches\/LRUCache\/CustomStringConvertible-Implementations","doc:\/\/Caches\/documentation\/Caches\/LRUCache\/Sequence-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifi